namespace ReachableNoDirectBerardFiniteControllerObserverConstructionForActualTruthAutomatonParityCurrentOrderHeader

/--
The older reachable-observer endpoint has exactly the data required by the
corrected direct-product observer interface.  This conversion lets all checked
finite-memory packages feed the new realized-truth completion route.
-/
noncomputable def toDirectProductObserverConstruction
    {In₁ : Type u} {In₂ : Type v} {Out₁ : Type x} {Out₂ : Type y}
    {A : DetParityAutomaton.{max u v x y, aut}
      (RoundRecord In₁ In₂ Graph Out₁ Out₂)}
